      "description": "Synthetic available-update specimen. The banner participates in scrolling content and is not an overlay or installer.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-specimen\"><span class=\"ds-specimen-label\">Пример интерфейса</span><aside class=\"ds-update\"><svg class=\"ds-update-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M21,10.12h-6.78l2.74,-2.82c-2.73,-2.7 -7.15,-2.8 -9.88,-0.1c-2.73,2.71 -2.73,7.08 0,9.79s7.15,2.71 9.88,0C18.32,15.65 19,14.08 19,12.1h2c0,1.98 -0.88,4.55 -2.64,6.29c-3.51,3.48 -9.21,3.48 -12.72,0c-3.5,-3.47 -3.53,-9.11 -0.02,-12.58s9.14,-3.47 12.65,0L21,3V10.12zM12.5,8v4.25l3.5,2.08l-0.72,1.21L11,13V8H12.5z\"/></svg><div class=\"ds-update-copy\"><strong>Доступно обновление</strong><small>Версия 1.0.1</small></div><button class=\"ds-update-action\" type=\"button\">Установить</button></aside></div>",
      "css": ".ds-specimen{padding:20px;background:#08080B;color:#EDEDF0}.ds-specimen-label{display:block;margin-bottom:10px;color:#A5A7B2;font:12px/18px 'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif}.ds-update{font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #3D477B;border-radius:16px;background:#1D2240;color:#E4E7FF}.ds-update-copy{flex:1}.ds-update strong{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:22px}.ds-update small{display:block;color:#C5CCEF;font-size:12px;line-height:18px}.ds-update-action{font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;min-height:48px;padding:0 8px;border:0;background:transparent;color:#9DAAFF;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;line-height:18px}.ds-update-action:hover{cursor:pointer}.ds-update-action:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #9DAAFF;outline-offset:2px}.ds-update-action:active{outline-offset:0}.ds-update-icon{color:#9DAAFF;flex-shrink:0}"
